OL,3,GNEWSACouncil approves #30m expansion of
OL,4,ASEND school
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to expand a school for children
OL,7,Fwith special educational needs and
OL,8,Fdisabilities have been approved by
OL,9,FLeeds City Council.
OL,11,FThe authority has pledged #30.6m of its
OL,12,Fcapital budget to demolish part of the
OL,13,Fexisting school at Broomfield South
OL,14,FSpecialist Inclusive Learning Centre in
OL,15,FBelle Isle, and build a new
OL,16,Fthree-storey teaching block.
OL,18,FTilbury Douglas Construction Ltd would
OL,19,Fbe responsible for the redevelopment at
OL,20,FBroom Place, a council report said.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
