OL,3,GNEWSACouncil approves #30m expansion of
OL,4,ASEND school
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe facility would provide 100 extra
OL,7,Fspaces, which would be staggered during
OL,8,Fthe 2027-28 academic year due to delays
OL,9,Fin the planning process, councillors
OL,10,Fwere told.
